# ToolGate environment — copy to `.env` and fill in. Do NOT commit `.env`.
# The container reads `.env` from the working directory at startup (infrastructure/env_file.py),
# so filling this in is enough. A variable already set in the environment wins, so an explicit
# export is never overridden by a stale file.
# The Jev (TypeSafe "System One") judgment model. Without it, gray calls fail closed
# (outage → ESCALATE, never silent-allow).
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
